    "detail": "We went to Boracay Island for 5 days 4 nights, and we chosen Eurotel Boracay initially because of the good location. Eurotel is conveniently located at Station 2, not at the beach front, but only about 3 minutes walk away from the beautiful white beach. After we arrived and began staying, we also found out that the staff are very friendly and attentive. The room is large and cleanliness has been kept quite well. As this is quite a new hotel, some parts of it are still undergoing construction but it didn't really affect anything. Overall, the stay at Eurotel has been really nice, relaxing and comfortable. We will return to stay if there is a chance.",
